{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32680","headline":"鄂州头陀寺上方 · 李频","name":"鄂州头陀寺上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高寺上方无不见，天涯行客思迢迢。\n西江帆挂东风急，夏口城衔楚塞遥。\n沙渚渔归多湿网，桑林蚕後尽空条。\n感时叹物寻僧话，惟向禅心得寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}